READ IN ORDER: (1) ${A.design_record} - the design object is the complete spec. (2) ${A.conventions} - the on-box conventions and provenance writer.
${A.exec_note ? 'EXECUTION DIRECTIVE (human, binding): ' + A.exec_note : ''}
