run_${A.tag}.py - stages extract / generate / endpoints, runnable independently. Save every generation or measurement verbatim per row. Every result record carries a run_valid field; any gate or anchor endpoint that fails writes run_valid=false into EVERY record written after it, per-cell files included, never only a summary - a void that lives in one file is not a void. A --selftest that is stdlib-only (guard heavy imports) covering every parser, every degenerate-output detector, and each endpoint's arithmetic on planted rows with known decisions, including a planted gate-failure row that must propagate run_valid=false. Nonzero exit on selftest failure. Never describe same-box reruns as replication in any output.
